  "html": "<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"color:var(--gold-light)\">Get In Touch</p>\n    <h1>Let's Talk About Your Accounting & Compliance Needs</h1>\n    <p>Whether it's a quick question or a full engagement, our team typically responds within one business day.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-actions\">\n      <a href=\"tel:+918286681960\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">📞 Call Us</a>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/918286681960\" class=\"btn btn-outline\">💬 WhatsApp Us</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"container contact-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Contact Details</p>\n      <h2 style=\"font-size:28px;margin-bottom:20px;\">Reach Us Directly</h2>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\">📍</div><div><h4>Office Address</h4><p>A Wing 401, Nerul Aakash Ganga CHS, Plot No. B-71, Seawoods East, Sector 23, Navi Mumbai, Maharashtra 400706</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\">📞</div><div><h4>Phone</h4><p><a href=\"tel:+918286681960\">+91 8286681960</a></p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\">✉️</div><div><h4>Email</h4><p><a href=\"mailto:abkhanassociates@gmail.com\">abkhanassociates@gmail.com</a></p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\">🕐</div><div><h4>Business Hours</h4><p>Mon – Sat: 10:00 AM – 07:00 PM</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"contact-info-item\"><div class=\"ci-icon\">💬</div><div><h4>WhatsApp</h4><p><a href=\"https://wa.me/918286681960\">Chat with us instantly</a></p></div></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:6px\">\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Facebook\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--off-white);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">f</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--off-white);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">ig</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" style=\"width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--off-white);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\">in</a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"map-embed\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://maps.google.com/maps?q=Seawoods%20East%20Sector%2023%20Navi%20Mumbai&t=&z=14&output=embed\"></iframe></div>\n    </div>\n    <form novalidate data-demo-form style=\"background:var(--white);padding:30px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid var(--grey)\">\n      <div class=\"form-row\">\n        <div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"ct-name\">Name *</label><input id=\"ct-name\" required></div>\n        <div class=\"form-group\"><label for=\"ct-phone\">Phone Number *</label><input id=\"ct-phone\" type=\"tel\" required></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-email\">Email Address *</label><input id=\"ct-email\" type=\"email\" required></div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-service\">Service Required</label>\n        <select id=\"ct-service\"><option>General Enquiry</option><option>Accounting</option><option>Taxation</option><option>GST</option><option>Audit</option><option>Business Registration</option><option>Billing Software</option></select>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"form-group full\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\"><label for=\"ct-msg\">Message *</label><textarea id=\"ct-msg\" rows=\"4\" required></textarea></div>\n      <label style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:500;font-size:13.5px;margin-bottom:16px\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ct-consent\" style=\"width:auto\" required> I consent to being contacted regarding my enquiry.</label>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-navy\" style=\"width:100%;justify-content:center\">Send Message</button>\n      <p class=\"form-note\">We typically respond within one business day.</p>\n      <div class=\"form-success\">✅ Thank you! We've received your message and will respond shortly.</div>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" style=\"background:var(--off-white);padding-top:0\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"cta-banner\">\n      <div><h3>Prefer to talk it through?</h3><p>Book a free consultation slot and we'll call you at a time that works.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Book Consultation</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"contact-faq\">\n  <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:820px\">\n    <div class=\"section-head center\"><p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">FAQ</p><h2>Before You Reach Out</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\">How quickly will I hear back? <span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>We aim to respond to all enquiries within one business day, often sooner during business hours.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\">Do I need to visit the office in person? <span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>No — most consultations and ongoing work are handled over phone, email, WhatsApp and our Client Portal.</p></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
